an","x":"Our Restructuring business maintained its leadership position, ranking #1 in U.S. and global completed restructurings for the first half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2019 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Now turning to each of our businesses in more detail, beginning with restructuring, compared to last year's levels, revenues decreased meaningfully in the third quarter, but held almost even for the nine month period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2019 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Given the increase in distress within certain industries, such as energy, media, telecommunications, pharma, consumer retail, our outlook for the full-year has become a bit more positive and we now expect full-year restructuring revenues to be up slightly year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2019 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Now turning to each of our businesses in more detail, beginning with Restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2019 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Our world-class restructuring franchise maintained its leadership position, ranking number one globally in dollar value of announced and completed restructurings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q1","e":"pjt","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Turning to each of our businesses in a bit more detail, in restructuring, our restructuring revenues rose significantly in the first quarter versus a year ago and more modestly on a sequential basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q1","e":"pjt","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Since the onset of the economic shutdown resulting from the pandemic we've experienced a dramatic increase in restructuring activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Our strong results were propelled by standout performance in our strategic advisory business, coupled with continued strong performance in restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Turning to restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Each of restructuring, PJT Park Hill and Strategic Advisory delivered strong performance in the quarter, with revenues in each business higher than a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Our strong momentum in strategic advisory heading into the year, combined with a balanced business model with leading pillars in restructuring, capital markets advisory, and shareholder engagement, has enabled us to gain market share in these turbulent times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"From the beginning, our intent was to build a premier, strategic advisory business from scratch fortified by leading restructuring and Park Hill businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2020 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Beginning with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q1","e":"pjt","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Our strategic advisory and PJT Park Hill businesses both deliver their strongest first quarters ever, more than offsetting declines in restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q1","e":"pjt","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"Now turning to each of our businesses in more detail, beginning with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"This time last year, most M&A activity was put on hold that advisory work centered around securing rescue capital and providing liability management and restructuring advice to companies severely impacted by the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul J. Taubman","x":"This has provided a dramatic catalyst to strategic activity, while also tamping down restructuring activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2021-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"In restructuring, while we continue to be quite bullish on the long-term outlook, the extraordinarily benign credit markets and the unprecedented physical and monetary policy support has meaningfully dampened the current restructuring environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2021 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2021-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"Against that backdrop, our 2021 restructuring revenues will return to 2019 levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/pjt-partners-inc-pjt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Jeffrey Taubman","x":"Last quarter's tariff uncertainties spark concerns about the potential for such dislocations to chill investment, trigger an economic slowdown and fan inflationary pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Jeffrey Taubman","x":"I think the third is strategic interest in a number of portfolio companies, which have been expressed, but then sort of retreated around Liberation day because of all of the uncertainties created by the proposed tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Therese Meates","x":"Restructuring revenues rose modestly in the second quarter and were up slightly for the first half, while PJT Park Hill revenues decreased year-over-year for both periods.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q2","e":"pjt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Jeffrey Taubman","x":"Beginning with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"That said, we still operate in a world fraught with risk, continuing geopolitical uncertainty, a weakening labor market, stubbornly high interest rates, tariff dislocations, coupled with concerns of an AI bubble have the potential to derail this pickup in activity levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"At the same time, certain corners of the economy are feeling the weight of relatively high interest rates, dislocations caused by higher tariffs, disruptions resulting from accelerating technological innovation and changing consumer preferences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Meates","x":"Restructuring revenues rose slightly in the third quarter and first 9 months, while PJT Park Hill revenues were flat in the third quarter and down modestly for the first 9 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"Beginning with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/pjt-pjt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helen Meates","x":"The growth in the fourth quarter was primarily driven by growth in restructuring and PJT Park Hill.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/pjt-partners-pjt-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"Beginning with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/pjt-partners-pjt-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2025 Q4","e":"pjt","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Taubman","x":"We've talked consistently about the fact that AI is going to be a disruptor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/pjt-partners-pjt-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2026 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Jeffrey Taubman","x":"Whether they be elevated interest rates, heightened geopolitical risk, greater market volatility, concerns about the sustainability of capital expenditures linked to AI or concerns regarding the disruptive impact of AI development.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/pjt-partners-pjt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2026 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2026-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Arun Kalra","x":"Revenues in Strategic Advisory, Restructuring and Park Hill decreased for the third quarter and in contrast revenues in these businesses increased for the 9-month period with record 9-month revenues in both Strategic Advisory and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/pjt-partners-pjt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PJT 2026 Q3","e":"pjt","d":"2026-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r"